  "title": "Reach Selects DeeperDive From Taboola, Gen AI Answer Engine Built for the Open Web, to Connect Readers with Timely, Contextual Answers for Topics They Care About",
  "summary": "New York, NY — Taboola (NASDAQ: TBLA) today announced that Reach has selected DeeperDive, a Gen AI answer engine that lives directly on publisher websites and leverages their own content. As part of the agreement, Reach will use DeeperDive across sites including Express and Daily Star. Today’s publishers face growing challenges from Generative AI-powered search […]",
